stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Active : Goal created with target amount

    state Active {
        [*] --> InProgress
        InProgress --> InProgress : Contribution added\n(total < target)
        InProgress --> InProgress : Contribution edited/removed\n(total < target)
    }

    Active --> Achieved : Contribution added/edited\n[total >= target]
    Achieved --> Active : Contribution edited/removed\n[total < target]

    note right of Active
        Decision Q-008:
        Preliminary drafts proposed 'Overdue' and 'Cancelled' states.
        Per human decision Q-008, these are deferred to post-v1.0.
        v1.0 models Active <--> Achieved transitions only.
    end note
